menu "Panel time"

    config PANEL_TIMEZONE
        string "Time zone, as a POSIX TZ string"
        default "CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3"
        help
            The clock, the calendar and the radar's times are local to this.
            The default is Central European Time with its summer time;
            Europe/London is "GMT0BST,M3.5.0/1,M10.5.0", US Eastern
            "EST5EDT,M3.2.0,M11.1.0".

endmenu
